      "text": [
        {
          "id": "title",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "#1 · Gebser pp.11–21, 255–58 (paraphrased); Taylor's P5 carrier; A20",
          "title": "The view grows confident of its own completeness",
          "italic": "Possession begins when the image's valuation governs what its source is allowed to be — the aloof neutrality presents situated authority as though its conditions had vanished.",
          "body": "",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.05,
          "width": 560,
          "size": 30,
          "align": "left"
        },
        {
          "id": "body1",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "The movement begins when formation grows confident: the view conceals the life from which it was selected, then treats whatever escapes its measure as deficient. Gebser gives perspectivity its achievement — Giotto's depth, Petrarch's landscape, Alberti's construction — and its restriction when one sector claims exclusive validity. Taylor's P5 carrier brings the pressure inside the viewer: body, history,",
          "x": 0.04,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 620,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left",
          "w": 520
        },
        {
          "id": "body2",
          "visible": true,
          "kicker": "",
          "title": "",
          "italic": "",
          "body": "language and concern affect what becomes salient. The absent Father gives this concealment its authorial image — lack numbed, a surrogate presence invoked as ultimate warrant while the view's own position exempts itself from the order it imposes. A20 receives the transition: possession occurs when the image's valuation governs what its source is allowed to be; the difference appears when the source resists.\n\nOccurrences: the confident enclosure (#0–#1); the invoked Father as warrant and displacement (#1); the resistant source (#1, #3).",
          "x": 0.6,
          "y": 0.47,
          "width": 505,
          "size": 14,
          "align": "left"
        }
      ],
